      "leash_base": 12.0,
      "leash_mob": 6.0,
      "cap_cover": 0.3,
      "cap_block": 0.3,
      "see": 16.0,
      "note_cover": "cover.melee: a hostile within reach + 1 at it with a block between (it does not see the agent), no hit taken in the next second, the agent sees that block; cover.arrow: an arrow aimed at its body stopped in a block it sees; decay and cap as the dodge's; not while it is far from the base in a waves scenario. block_credit: a hostile going for an agent or the base whose straight way (4 blocks ahead) runs into a block the crew put, or a pit it dug, while an agent within see of it sees the mob: once a (mob, block) a wave, to the decision that put or dug it by the event's chain; ready.wall/ready.moat: the ring wall / the moat whole at a wave's start. Altogether capped under what holding the base pays (clean_wave 1.0, wave_cleared 0.5, kills)",
      "note": "trade.kill x max(0, 1 - health lost in window_s / hp_scale) for a kill; trade.recover when health went under low_hp, came back to high_hp and the agent hit a mob within back_s; dodge.melee: a hostile within reach (horizontally) targeting it and no hit taken in the next second; dodge.arrow: an arrow aimed at its body gone by; a dodge only when the agent is not shut in and is within leash_base of the base or leash_mob of the mob (else it is flight: no bonus, the idling's and the wasted day's); the same mob dodged again without a hit on it: decay^k; the points of a wave (a minute without waves) at most cap_trade and cap_dodge"
    },
